  "privacyPolicyLabel": "Privacy policy",
  "privacyPolicyBody": "At Commander Khenchela, we respect your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect and how we use it.\n\nData we collect: full name, phone number, delivery address, and your location (only if enabled in your device settings, to show nearby shops). We also keep your order history and favorites within the app.\n\nHow we use your data: to process and deliver your orders, send you notifications about their status, and improve your experience in the app.\n\nWho sees your data: the shop you order from only sees the information needed to prepare and deliver your order (name, phone, address). We do not sell or share your data with any advertising third party.\n\nData security: all your data is transmitted over an encrypted connection, with strict rules preventing any user from accessing another user's data.\n\nYour rights: you may request to correct or delete your data at any time by contacting us.\n\nContact: support@commanderkhenchela.dz",
  "termsLabel": "Terms and conditions",
  "termsBody": "By using the Commander Khenchela app, you agree to the following terms:\n\nThe service: the app is an intermediary platform connecting Khenchela's shops and restaurants with customers, including a delivery service. Payment is currently cash on delivery only.\n\nOrders: once a shop confirms your order, it becomes final; it can only be cancelled before that confirmation, or by the administration in exceptional cases.\n\nYour responsibility: provide accurate information (name, phone, address) to ensure your order is delivered correctly.\n\nShops' responsibility: each shop is responsible for the quality of its products and the accuracy of the information it publishes; Commander Khenchela acts as an intermediary and is not responsible for the product's quality itself.\n\nChanges: these terms may be updated; any significant change will be announced within the app.\n\nContact: support@commanderkhenchela.dz",
